WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.650
In the autumn of 2020,
war returned to Artsakh for 44 days,

2
00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.424
fought with drones
above the ridgelines.

3
00:00:10.664 --> 00:00:12.554
Civilians were struck on both sides,

4
00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:16.953
and Ghazanchetsots Cathedral
in Shushi was struck twice.

5
00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:20.423
In early November,
Azerbaijani special forces

6
00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:22.243
climbed to the Shushi plateau,

7
00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:23.950
and the town fell.

8
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:28.104
Young conscripts and volunteers
had held the line to the end.

9
00:00:28.344 --> 00:00:30.898
Hold the heights, defender.

